      "id": "claim_846b01898730440f915d952db3be4143",
      "statement": "BridgeClient is a requests.Session-based client with verify=False (Hue bridge serves a self-signed certificate; urllib3 insecure-request warnings are disabled at module import); every request targets https://{bridge_ip}/clip/v2{path} with the app key sent as the hue-application-key header and a default 5 s timeout.",
